WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.760
In this lesson, you will learn to add 1 to a score each time a gem is collected, and check the score at the end.

2
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:13.260
The score counts how well you are doing.

3
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.200
It starts at 0.

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.050
Each time you collect a gem, add 1 to the score.

5
00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.880
Collect 3 gems → score 3.

6
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:26.040
The score matches the gems!

7
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.930
Games say “You win!” when the score is big enough.

8
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.940
Collect 3 gems. After each one, add 1 to ⭐ score. End with score 3.

9
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:35.690
Score 3! One point for every gem.

10
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:41.100
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.120
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
